  "comments": "<p>Pedro I (1798-1834) was the founder and first ruler of the Empire of Brazil.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>Year varieties:</u></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">NOTE: SCWC New edition: KM#649.3 no longer exists. Despite that it is considered that:<br>KM#649.2 \"T\" wholly inside stripes on Rev.;<br>KM#649.3 \"T\" partially inside stripes.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5cf91146c78e1.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5cf91146c78e1.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Placement of “T” from 1998-2002 and 2003-present.</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/561ea379b0fb9.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/561ea379b0fb9.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">Double strike in date for year 2001.</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5a1e8d039827c.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5a1e8d039827c.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Rim variations for year 2012.</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5eefb034e0bfc.png\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5eefb034e0bfc.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">New die introduced in 2017.<br>Its distinctive feature was the replacement of a Dot amongst the chest medals by a Star</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><u>Official year sets:</u></strong></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce1f41ac361.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce1f41ac361.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce1f4c99b15.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce1f4c99b15.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">Official Sets - 2018 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4d855fff.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d87a4e1d1e0e.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2019 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b6e785bb.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce2b71c0f43.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">Official card with complete set, including 1 real commemorative coin</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce1f8a82f21.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce1f8a82f21.jpg\"></a> <a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/67ce1f8f96d52.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/67ce1f8f96d52.jpg\"></a></p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\">Official Sets - 2020 - Mintage 3000 Sets</p><p style=\"margin-left:2em;\"><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6206c9aa2620d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6206c9aa2620d.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6206c9b9a0b97.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6206c9b9a0b97.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>Official Sets - 2021 - Mintage 5000 Sets</p>",
